/* MacClean — English
 *
 * Translated from ko.lproj. Keep the keys in sync.
 * A missing key shows the key itself on screen — that is deliberate.
 *
 * Tone: plain and direct. This app deletes files; hedging language
 * makes people distrust it, and marketing language makes them distrust it more.
 */

